      "title": "3D Exhibit Designer Intern",
      "description": "3D Exhibit Designer Intern | ET Global Limited Partnership | Handshake Home Learn More Help You are viewing a preview of this job. Log in or register to view more details about this job. 3D Exhibit Designer Intern ET Global Limited Partnership Tweet Email 3D Exhibit Designer Intern Job Title: 3D Exhibit Designer Intern Location: Suwanee, Georgia Position Type: Full-Time We are seeking a 3D Exhibit Design Intern to support our creative and design teams in developing visually compelling exhibit concepts and production-ready assets. This internship offers hands-on exposure to real client projects, from concept through execution. You will collaborate with designers, project managers, and production teams to help translate ideas into engaging physical environments. 3D Design Support Assist in creating 3D exhibit renderings and layouts for trade shows and experiential environments Support development of booth concepts, spatial layouts, and visual storytelling elements Modify and refine designs based on internal and client feedback Cross-Functional Collaboration Partner with project managers, fabrication teams, and account teams to ensure design feasibility Learn how designs translate into real-world builds and installations Education Currently pursuing a degree in: Industrial Design Interior Design Architecture or related field Skills Familiarity with design tools such as: Adobe Creative Suite (Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign) SketchUp, Rhino, 3ds Max, or similar 3D software Basic understanding of 3D modeling and rendering principles Strong visual, layout, and conceptual thinking skills Preferred Exposure to environmental design, exhibit design, or retail/experiential design Interest in physical environments and spatial storytelling"
